# Orbis (PS4/PS5) imports by NID: the first eight bytes of SHA-1(name + the system's salt), reversed, base 64 ('+' '-', no padding),
# computed for the names of the functions programs are known to call (the C library, the POSIX/BSD interface, Sony library functions
# OpenOrbis's headers and the PS5 payload SDK's programs name).  [functions]: NID name, sorted by NID text.  [syscalls]: number name, sorted by number (stable).

